'''The Celestial Watch''' is an observatory in [[Karazhan]]. This is the room where [[Khadgar]] was brought to [[Medivh]] for the first time. Back then the walls and ceilings were pierced by crystalline windows, clear and unfogged, with a brazier for heating. All manner of devices such as astrolabes and ancient texts were spread around the area. A map of the [[Eastern Kingdoms]] was stretched on a frame.<ref>''[[The Last Guardian]]''</ref>

It is where the [[Echo of Medivh]] is fought in the [[Tower of Karazhan]] raid.

